1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,642
Put them down!

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,955
She's here for help!

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:08,316
My sister's fevered all night,

4
00:00:08,716 --> 00:00:10,338
Doctor, save her.

5
00:00:10,407 --> 00:00:13,547
Liuxi? An hour away,

6
00:00:13,625 --> 00:00:15,806
this old man can't ride.

7
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:17,924
You don't have to.

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:18,920
Hold on tight.

9
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,081
They're gaining!

10
00:00:25,253 --> 00:00:26,428
Soldiers behind us!

11
00:00:26,643 --> 00:00:28,008
S-slow down!

12
00:00:28,502 --> 00:00:29,135
Eyes shut,

13
00:00:29,202 --> 00:00:30,247
count to a hundred.

14
00:00:32,745 --> 00:00:34,230
Ninety-eight,

15
00:00:34,379 --> 00:00:36,070
Ninety-nine…

16
00:00:36,672 --> 00:00:38,321
Xiaohe, hold on a bit.

17
00:00:38,393 --> 00:00:38,825
A-Ling?

18
00:00:39,593 --> 00:00:40,780
Where's the patient?

19
00:00:41,227 --> 00:00:43,523
The fever's gone on too long,

20
00:00:43,595 --> 00:00:45,183
bring it down first.

21
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,953
All of it, in one go.

22
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:48,681
Good girl, drink and you'll cool down.

23
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:52,295
We'll know by dawn if it breaks.

24
00:00:52,702 --> 00:00:53,641
I'll keep watch.

25
00:00:58,302 --> 00:01:01,144
A-Ling affection: plus twelve.

26
00:01:01,227 --> 00:01:04,943
Affection fifty, reward chest unlocked.

27
00:01:05,006 --> 00:01:07,412
Acquired: glassmaking method.

28
00:01:08,037 --> 00:01:10,442
Quartz sand, a high-heat kiln…

29
00:01:10,557 --> 00:01:12,272
Shelve it for now.

30
00:01:13,003 --> 00:01:14,145
Brother…

31
00:01:14,218 --> 00:01:15,578
It's gone!

32
00:01:16,006 --> 00:01:16,775
She's cool!

33
00:01:16,827 --> 00:01:17,391
Gone?

34
00:01:18,027 --> 00:01:20,381
Once it breaks, she's safe.

35
00:01:20,453 --> 00:01:22,131
The day Brother fell in,

36
00:01:22,371 --> 00:01:23,998
I saw someone push.

37
00:01:24,336 --> 00:01:24,835
Who?

38
00:01:25,536 --> 00:01:27,961
Straw hat, red string,

39
00:01:28,033 --> 00:01:29,908
I didn't see a face.

40
00:01:29,990 --> 00:01:31,261
Red string…

41
00:01:31,841 --> 00:01:32,977
The Qian side gate.

42
00:01:33,041 --> 00:01:34,552
Xu Yan, the granary—

43
00:01:34,616 --> 00:01:36,074
it's out of hand.

44
00:01:36,143 --> 00:01:36,627
Diao Qi?

45
00:01:41,743 --> 00:01:43,941
Wait for Scholar Xu!

46
00:01:44,119 --> 00:01:45,867
Do it, if you dare.

47
00:01:45,941 --> 00:01:46,636
Stop!

48
00:01:47,835 --> 00:01:48,793
I caught him,

49
00:01:49,448 --> 00:01:51,334
he's not yours to touch.

50
00:01:53,463 --> 00:01:55,496
Liuxi's Scholar Xu?

51
00:01:55,564 --> 00:01:58,334
The village wants his answer.

52
00:01:58,794 --> 00:02:00,477
Keep him, or give him to them.

53
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:05,085
Your call, Scholar.
